            "detailed_description": "Slingshot Hero VR was originally designed as an event VR game. After receiving tremendous feedback from players, it is now available as a full release game. Grab your slingshot and start shooting in this arcade style throwback to the NES era. With full 360° tracking, beautiful scenery, immersive sounds, and realistic physics, this game is sure to grab your attention and create rivalries between your friends.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Choose between multiple projectile types<br />\r\n- Race against the clock to achieve the highest score you can<br />\r\n- Find all the hidden objects<br />\r\n- Realistic slingshot motions<br />\r\n- Persistent high score tracking to compete with friends<br />\r\n- Playable both with OR without VR hardware",
